# project: wcag-2.2-aa-conformance
// Get the web app to WCAG 2.2 AA before the regulatory deadline.
// weeks_to_deadline models the runway legal tracks; each re-audit round
// consumes roughly four weeks of it.
VAR weeks_to_deadline = 16

=== external_audit ===
External auditors assess the web app against WCAG 2.2 AA and deliver the
violation inventory, tiered critical / serious / moderate. Done when the
inventory is in hand and triaged.
* [Violation inventory delivered] -> ci_guardrails

=== ci_guardrails ===
Automated accessibility checks wired into CI so fixed violations cannot
regress. Done when the checks block merges on regressions.
* [CI blocks accessibility regressions] -> fix_critical

=== fix_critical ===
Teams work the critical tier of the violation inventory first. Done when
every critical finding is fixed and passing the CI checks.
+ [Critical tier resolved] -> fix_serious

=== fix_serious ===
Teams work the serious tier next. Done when every serious finding is fixed
and passing the CI checks.
+ [Serious tier resolved] -> re_audit

=== re_audit ===
External auditors re-assess after the critical and serious tiers. New
findings go back into the fix queue; legal tracks the remaining runway.
~ weeks_to_deadline -= 4
+ [Clean on critical and serious] -> fix_moderate
+ {weeks_to_deadline >= 8} [New findings, runway remains] ~loop~ -> fix_critical
+ {weeks_to_deadline < 8} [Serious issues with under eight weeks left] @human -> vp_escalation

=== vp_escalation ===
The VP of engineering decides whether to pull people from other teams to
protect the deadline. Fix work resumes with the reinforced roster.
+ [Reinforcements assigned, resume fixes] @human ~loop~ -> fix_critical

=== fix_moderate ===
Teams work the moderate tier. Done when moderate findings are fixed and the
CI checks stay green.
+ [Moderate tier resolved] -> legal_signoff

=== legal_signoff ===
Legal reviews the final conformance statement and signs it.
+ [Legal signs the conformance statement] @human -> publish_statement
+ [Legal requests changes] @human ~loop~ -> fix_moderate

=== publish_statement ===
Publish the accessibility statement page with the signed conformance
statement. Done when the page is live.
-> END
